              "value": "(disease, necromancy); DC 29 Fortitude; Maximum Duration 6 rounds; Stage 1: 3d6 negative damage (1 round); Stage 2: 3d6 negative damage and drained 1 (1 round); Stage 3: 3d6 negative damage and drained 2 (1 round)"
